        "Description": "Good evening 47.\rWe have been tasked with the elimination of Anderson Silviero, a successful &apos;Providence&apos; operative.\rDespite being young, Silviero quickly rose in the hierarchy of &apos;Providence&apos; working for various firms under their control. Some years ago, he helped getting the dictator Richard Ekwensi elected.\rOur client, Lucas Grey, wants the influence of &apos;Providence&apos; stopped.\rEliminate the target, avoiding all collateral damages.\rGood luck 47, I&apos;ll leave you to prepare.\rMission status: ACTIVE",
